cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Colby GPU Cluster: Native SwiftUI macOS Menu-Bar App Visualizing Slurm GPU Node, Job and Queue State on the Colby College HPC Cluster"
abstract: "Native SwiftUI macOS menu-bar app that renders the Colby College HPC Slurm GPU partition as a pannable, zoomable isometric city: free, allocated and unavailable GPUs per node, running jobs with elapsed and wall-clock limits, the pending queue with scheduler reasons, and reservations. Reads Colby's public GPU status page or any colby-gpu-status/1 JSON feed, or polls Slurm over SSH."
authors:
